  "content": "<h1>Xaero的地图 × 传送石碑</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwakatime.com%252f%2540e0eb8abf-071e-4f83-bc68-6f100cbe60db%252fprojects%252fqlzcwbempk%253fstart%253d2026-04-26%2526end%253d2026-05-02\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wakatime.com/badge/user/e0eb8abf-071e-4f83-bc68-6f100cbe60db/project/4ec2a2ac-3cb6-48c5-9759-0cb1679c5e6a.svg?style=flat\" alt=\"wakatime\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fxaeros-maps-x-waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/iv2jCzkP?logo=modrinth&amp;style=flat\" alt=\"Modrinth下载量\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-maps-x-waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1340197?logo=curseforge&amp;style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge下载量\"></a></p><h2>⚠️ 阅读前须知</h2><ul>\n<li>如果路径点不可见，请在Xaero的小地图设置中启用\"渲染所有路径点集\"</li>\n<li>如果已安装YACL但仍显示\"未安装YACL\"，请尝试降级YACL</li>\n<li>请通过<a href=\"https://github.com/alinco8/XaerosMaps-x-Waystones/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issues</a>提交Bug报告\n而非CurseForge评论区，谢谢🙏</li>\n</ul><h2>🫶 支持</h2><p>喜欢这个模组吗？您可以点击下方横幅租用服务器来支持其开发！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshort.alinco8.dev%252fbh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/46b5e2aa-795e-4034-b94d-2247b5b3c7bf.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p><p>您还可以查看我的其他模组！</p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alinco8/XaerosMaps-MultiplayerPlus/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/xmmp/icon.png\" alt=\"Xaero的地图：多人游戏增强+\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-maps-multiplayer-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero的地图：多人游戏增强+（审查中）</a></td>\n<td>为Xaero的小地图和世界地图添加多人游戏功能，例如世界地图同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>🗺️ 概述</h2><p>只需放置一个传送石碑，它就会自动作为路径点添加到Xaero的小地图/世界地图中。</p><p>放置、移除和重命名都会自动同步。</p><blockquote>\n  <p>目前仅支持<strong>传送石碑</strong>。其他方块如共享石碑暂不支持。</p>\n</blockquote><h2>⚙️ 自定义</h2><p>通过游戏内设置或配置文件精细调整行为。</p><h2>📷 截图</h2><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alinco8/XaerosMaps-x-Waystones/refs/heads/main/docs/images/config.webp\" alt=\"设置\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alinco8/XaerosMaps-x-Waystones/refs/heads/main/docs/images/gameplay.webp\" alt=\"游戏画面\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alinco8/XaerosMaps-x-Waystones/refs/heads/main/docs/images/world-map.webp\" alt=\"世界地图\"></p>",
